---
/**
 * Urgent but calm — DESIGN-NOTES §6.4. Navy field, big date, no red, no warning
 * icon. The date is static copy, never a JS countdown (CLAUDE.md §3.6).
 */
---

<section class="bg-ink text-surface">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-site section-y px-5 md:px-8">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-h2 font-bold">
          Windows 10 od 13. oktobra 2026. ostaje bez bezbednosnih ispravki.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-[62ch] text-surface/80">
          Besplatno proveravamo koje vaše mašine mogu na Windows 11 — i šta je jeftinije
          zameniti nego produžavati. Bez obaveze.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4 lg:justify-self-end">
        <a
          href="#kontakt"
          class="inline-block rounded-card border border-surface/40 px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold transition-colors hover:border-surface hover:bg-surface hover:text-ink"
        >
          Zakažite proveru
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
